            "review_title": "Review at Papa's Chicken & Pizza - The Manor",
            "review_text": "ann_cao\nHanoi, Vietnam116 contributions\n0\nMy favourite Korean fried chicken\nAug 2017 • Friends\nThis is where I often go for Korean fried chicken. The chicken with sweet and sour sauce is amazing. I also like the fish cake soup, which is great if you have it in winter because it has lots of ground pepper and white radish, which brings a natural sweetness to the soup. \nThe drawback of the eatery is that it's too far from city center.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 6, 2018",
